{"id":"fdaf6d8a626c","publishedAt":1794546009000,"posts":[[{"img":"https://livedoor.sp.blogimg.jp/kinisoku/imgs/b/4/b44c05a0.jpg"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":"事件概要 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 鳥取で来場者5万人、経済規模10億円のフードフェス開催 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 実際は500人しか来ず大損害 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 飲食店がSNSで声をあげる "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 主催者は消息不明になり大炎上 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ようやくXに現れて謝罪するも他責＆嘘が多すぎてまた炎上しアカウント削除 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 実は主催者は2人いて、そのもう1人は令和の虎に出ていたことが発覚し炎上 "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"href":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120839745362436096/vid/avc1/2622x1206/SjYvqVJa80S1141J.mp4","text":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120839745362436096/vid/avc1/2622x1206/SjYvqVJa80S1141J.mp4"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" ↓ "},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"href":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120839365396176896/vid/avc1/1560x860/F-G6tk3h1_NwVfCj.mp4","text":"https://video.twimg.com/amplify_video/2120839365396176896/vid/avc1/1560x860/F-G6tk3h1_NwVfCj.mp4"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(255, 0, 0)","text":"出店料は返せよ"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":">>3"},{"br":1},{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":" 炎上したので逃亡中"}],[{"bold":true,"color":"rgb(51, 102, 255)","text":"「人を巻き込んで仕事するのに向いてない属性の人」って予め言われてた"}],[{"color":"rgb(0, 102, 255)","bold":true,"text":"事件概要 "},{"br":1},{"color":"rgb(0, 102, 255)","bold":true,"text":" ヤフーの記事"},{"br":1},{"text":"\n\n\n\n〈鳥取・グルメイベント大惨事